    <briefdescription>
<para>Unified input validation for all serializers. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Performs the following checks:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Input is not empty</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Input size does not exceed kMaxModelInputBytes</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Input is not truncated (ends with valid structure markers)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Input has valid UTF-8 encoding (for text formats)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Input contains recognizable format markers </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
